========================================================================================================================
E3 - FINAL SYSTEM: ENSEMBLE OF 3 MODELS (ISL sentence -> English), output log
========================================================================================================================
members (equal weight 1/3 each):
  Model 1  fine-tuned SigLIP ViT-B/16                     outputs/siglip_b16_stage2/best.pt  (sha256 e5ee11603518cc31)
  Model 2  frozen CLIP ViT-B/16                           outputs/clip_b16_stage1/best.pt  (sha256 ee86be3eace66605)
  Model 3  frozen SigLIP + MediaPipe hand/body landmarks  experiments/prediction_improvement_v1/runs/H1_siglip_landmarks/best.pt  (sha256 a9736646acb0336f)
how it predicts : 32 frames sampled evenly with 5% trimmed at each end (trim_5) -> each model computes the log-probability
                  of each of the 97 training sentences (including end-of-sentence) -> the three scores are averaged ->
                  the highest is the prediction; softmax over the 97 averaged scores = confidence %
candidates      : the 97 normalized sentences of the training split (signers 1-5); never from validation or test
speed           : about 2.7 s per video = MediaPipe on CPU 2.27 s + Model 3 GPU 0.13 s + Models 1-2 GPU 0.27 s (RTX 3050 6 GB)
selection       : chosen on validation signer 6 (and confirmed on signers 3-5) before any signer-7 evaluation; see SELECTION_RULES.md

